trace.zip (Playwright trace) — PENDING
=====================================

Playwright genera `trace.zip` por test fallido (config: `trace: 'on-first-retry'`).
Cuando se ejecute el spec con dev servers arriba (F3), el trace va a:

  apps/frontend/test-results/variant-attribute-options-catalog-spec-chromium/trace.zip

Para visualizar:
  pnpm --filter @sistema/frontend exec playwright show-trace \
    apps/frontend/test-results/variant-attribute-options-catalog-spec-chromium/trace.zip

Mientras tanto: NO hay trace porque no se ejecutó (dev servers DOWN, AGENTS.md).